// The citizen-facing surface speaks the languages of the OneAquaHealth pilot sites: Greek for the
// Cretan streams, Italian for Benevento, English as the fallback. Clinician-facing pages and the
// alert text generated by the API stay in English (see docs/ARCHITECTURE.md).
//
// Kept deliberately small: a flat dictionary and a lookup, no routing segments and no dependency.

